   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: a candidate is a (link, neighbor) pair",
   "originalText": "How it works: a candidate is a (link, neighbor) pair",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 953,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SPF uses the cheapest link of a bundle: dist(S,E) = 10. A link is a primary next-hop link only if it\ncosts dist(S,E), so S-E is primary and S-E#2 is not. Each primary link gets its own protection.",
   "originalText": "SPF uses the cheapest link of a bundle: dist(S,E) = 10. A link is a primary next-hop link only if it\ncosts dist(S,E), so S-E is primary and S-E#2 is not. Each primary link gets its own protection.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 724,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S → E, protect S-E: every other link out of S is a candidate (B3–B7)",
   "originalText": "S → E, protect S-E: every other link out of S is a candidate (B3–B7)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 253,
   "width": 740,
   "height": 80,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Candidate        Loop-free              Downstream   Node-prot.  Cost\n---------------  ---------------------  -----------  ----------  ------------\nA over S-A       20 < 15 + 10 = 25  ✓   20 < 10  ✗   –           15 + 20 = 35\nE over S-E#2      0 < 10 + 10 = 20  ✓    0 < 10  ✓   never ✗     20 +  0 = 20",
   "originalText": "Candidate        Loop-free              Downstream   Node-prot.  Cost\n---------------  ---------------------  -----------  ----------  ------------\nA over S-A       20 < 15 + 10 = 25  ✓   20 < 10  ✗   –           15 + 20 = 35\nE over S-E#2      0 < 10 + 10 = 20  ✓    0 < 10  ✓   never ✗     20 +  0 = 20",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 343,
   "width": 953,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Best LFA: E over S-E#2 (both link-only, and it is downstream). It protects the link, not the router.",
   "originalText": "Best LFA: E over S-E#2 (both link-only, and it is downstream). It protects the link, not the router.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 375,
   "width": 490,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
