   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Adj-SIDs of S:  A 24000   S-E 24001   S-E#2 24002\nAdj-SIDs of E:  E-D 24000   E-D#2 24001   S-E 24002   S-E#2 24003",
