   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why it is never node-protecting",
   "originalText": "Why it is never node-protecting",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-44",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 830,
   "width": 372,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 348436,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4608076,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For another link L2 to E itself, N = E:",
   "originalText": "For another link L2 to E itself, N = E:",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-45",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 862,
   "width": 362,
   "height": 70,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 356355,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4712805,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "loop-free   dist(E,D) < dist(E,S)+dist(S,D)\n            always ✓ (E is on S’s path)\ndownstream  dist(E,D) < dist(S,D)       ✓\nnode-prot.  dist(E,D) < 0 + dist(E,D)   ✗",
   "originalText": "loop-free   dist(E,D) < dist(E,S)+dist(S,D)\n            always ✓ (E is on S’s path)\ndownstream  dist(E,D) < dist(S,D)       ✓\nnode-prot.  dist(E,D) < 0 + dist(E,D)   ✗",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-46",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 942,
   "width": 448,
   "height": 64,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 364274,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4817534,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "So it protects the link only (RFC 5286 §3.6). A\nnode-protecting LFA through another router wins\n(B7).",
   "originalText": "So it protects the link only (RFC 5286 §3.6). A\nnode-protecting LFA through another router wins\n(B7).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
