   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a10-text-49",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 830,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 149,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 388031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5131721,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Two equal links to E are two primary next hops:\n   ECMP-protected (E → D here).\n•  Remote LFA uses the protected link’s own metric.\n   Another link to E is never a tunnel exit (E would\n   be an LFA).\n•  Every link direction has its own Adj-SID, so an\n   Adj-SID names one link.",
   "originalText": "•  Two equal links to E are two primary next hops:\n   ECMP-protected (E → D here).\n•  Remote LFA uses the protected link’s own metric.\n   Another link to E is never a tunnel exit (E would\n   be an LFA).\n•  Every link direction has its own Adj-SID, so an\n   Adj-SID names one link.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
